# not use stay blank instead of flowing to a later section, which is what keeps
# a section from showing fewer rows on a taller screen.
# SHOW says what is drawn: the "title", the unreachable "banner", the "qcap"
# standing in for an absent queue table, the skipped-row "notes", the "nodes"
# (1 = one summary line, 2 = in full) and their ↳ "reasons", the finished block
# "fin" (1 = one line, 2 = the block) and its "fslots" (rows, plus "+N more"),
# and the blank lines b0-b4.  QUOTA[x] is how many rows section x keeps, -1
# while not even its "… n jobs" line is drawn.
